":"solicitudes de unión mediante Rich Presence."},"3910":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-9","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Estos callbacks son infraestructura. El gameplay debería reaccionar a los estados de Eco resultantes, no acoplar cada sistema del juego directamente a Steamworks."},"3911":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-10","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Steam callback → integración Steam → Eco → sistema de juego."},"3912":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks-11","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/callbacks#eventos-relevantes","content":"Evita Steam callback → Torre, Steam callback → UI, Steam callback → combate, etc."},"3913":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"page","content":"Conexión P2P","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Red","Red","Contenido","Steam"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-0","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","content":"Cómo Steam transporta una conexión Eco entre dos usuarios."},"3915":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-1","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#flujo","content":"Flujo"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-2","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#conectar-manualmente","content":"Conectar manualmente"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-3","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p#sesiones","content":"Sesiones"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/steam/conexion-p2p-